# Amari agent bridge (website)

Canonical Cursor bridge: `claude-config/.cursor/rules/amari-agent-bridge.mdc`.

At session start on Amari work, run:
`bash /agent/repos/claude-config/scripts/cursor-session-orient.sh`
(or `bash ~/code/claude-config/scripts/cursor-session-orient.sh` locally)

Read matching skills from `claude-config/skills/` before improvising. For staff-app work, triage with `skills/todo/SKILL.md` when the task might already be solved.

Vault todos and session notes: `/agent/repos/amari-method-docs/ops/open-todos.md` and `NOTES.txt`.
